# Keep the build context and image small: wxingest only needs the Go sources
# and the aviation data that av.InitDB reads from resources/. It takes the
# facilities to ingest from facilities.json rather than the scenarios, and
# needs none of the models, videomaps, traffic, or bundled weather that the
# vice client uses.
.git
whisper.cpp
sherpa-onnx
resources/models
resources/scenarios
resources/traffic
resources/videomaps
resources/wx
vice
*.prof
*.pprof
